sequenceDiagram
    participant Site as Website (tracking.js)
    participant API as Express API
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant SY as Sync Worker
    participant DK as DuckDB
    participant CA as Cache
    participant UI as Dashboard SPA

    Site->>API: POST /track/events (pageview/click/session)
    API->>PG: Validate + insert raw data
    PG-->>API: ACK

    loop every sync interval
        SY->>PG: Read new rows > last_synced_at
        PG-->>SY: Delta rows
        SY->>DK: Upsert analytics replica
        SY->>DK: Update _sync_meta
    end

    UI->>API: GET /api/analytics/*
    API->>CA: Check key by site/date/filter
    alt cache hit
        CA-->>API: Cached payload
    else cache miss
        API->>DK: Run aggregation query
        DK-->>API: Result set
        API->>CA: Store with route TTL
    end
    API-->>UI: JSON metrics + timeseries
